% review-findings: No words. Our N: line quotes Fox Strangways calling the singer, a domestic servant on a colonial steamer, "an unmusical ayah": colonial condescension, in our notes rather than in the song.
% review-suggestion: Keep the melody; rephrase that note in our own words (one of the songs an ayah, a children's nurse, sang on board a steamer; the book says she lost her key and the songs were hard to piece together) and restore.
